      "name": "⭐️ Pepel Zorya Unleash",
      "npc_rank": "",
      "other_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Can only be used when<strong> Pepel Zorya </strong>is inflicted with<strong> <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn} </strong>with duration<strong> </strong>of<strong> 5</strong> or more rounds<strong>.<br>Pepel Zorya&nbsp;</strong>consumes her <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}</strong>, decreases its duration by <strong>5</strong> rounds, and receive <strong>Baptism of Fire, </strong>which can <strong>NOT </strong>be removed by <strong>Dispel.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Fire Emblem: Baptism of Fire",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Can only be used when every creature in the conflict is inflicted with <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Pepel Zorya</strong> decreases the duration of <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}&nbsp;</strong>on every creature by <strong>1</strong> round and summons <strong>Lingering Flame</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Fire Emblem: Lingering Flame",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Can only be used on a creature is inflicted with <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn} </strong>with duration<strong> </strong>of<strong> 5</strong> or more rounds<strong>.</strong></p>\n<p>Decreases the duration of <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}&nbsp;</strong>on the target creature by <strong>5</strong> rounds and inflict them with <strong>Divine Condemn, </strong>which can <strong>NOT </strong>be removed by <strong>Dispel</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Divine Condemn </strong>will be removed automatically when&nbsp;<strong>Fire Emblem: Divine Condemn&nbsp;</strong>is inactive.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Fire Emblem: Divine Condemn",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Deals <strong>Fire </strong>damage to all enemy equals to<strong>【Duration of <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn} on all creature in the scene x 2】</strong>. Then, removes <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}&nbsp;</strong>from <strong>all </strong>creatures in the scene. This attack ignore <strong>Fire </strong>resistance/immunity.</p>\n<p>After the attack is resolved, <strong>Pepel Zorya Unleash</strong> loses all its <strong>Fire Emblems</strong> and enter <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/faze.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MziQo5K1cu829GIU]{Break} </strong>without losing her Actions.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "【💥Zero Power】 Merciless Sun",
          "roll": ""
        }
      },
      "rare": false,
      "resource_value_1": "0",
      "resource_value_2": "0",
      "resource_value_3": "0",
      "rolled_atr1": "DEX",
      "rolled_atr2": "DEX",
      "shield_type": "PHYSICAL",
      "shield_value": "0",
      "spear_ef": "100",
      "spear_vu": "NA",
      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p><strong>Pepel Zorya Unleash </strong>has <strong>3 Actions</strong>,&nbsp;has<strong> NO Break Clock.</strong></p>\n<p>Also, <strong>Pepel Zorya&nbsp;</strong>does NOT have<strong> Basic Attack</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Exhausted Supreme Entity"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p><strong>Pepel Zorya&nbsp;</strong>does NOT receive damage from&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Flameborn"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>While <strong>Pepel Zorya</strong> is in the conflict, any <strong>skill&nbsp;</strong>or&nbsp;<strong>spell&nbsp;</strong>that can remove <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}&nbsp;</strong>will only decrease its duration by <strong>3.</strong></p>\n<p>Furthermore, when a creature already inflicted with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn} </strong>receives <strong>Fire&nbsp;</strong>damage, their <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}&nbsp;</strong>duration will be increase by <strong>1</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Immolator"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Whenever <strong>Pepel Zorya </strong>summons a <strong>Fire Emblem</strong>, fills its <strong>Zero Power Clock</strong> by <strong>2</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Fire Emblem"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>At the start of each round,<strong> Pepel Zorya</strong>&nbsp;recovers <strong>Hit Points</strong> and <strong>Mind Points</strong> equals to <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn} </strong>damage.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Baptism of Fire"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When a creature with <strong>Divine Condemn </strong>receives&nbsp;<strong>Fire&nbsp;</strong>damage, if it is inflcted with <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}</strong>, it will receives extra damage equal to <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}&nbsp;</strong>damage. This extra damage does <strong>NOT </strong>decrease<strong>&nbsp;</strong>duration of <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}&nbsp;</strong>on the creature.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Divine Condemn"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When Pepel Zorya is inflicted with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/DEFENSE%20DOUBLE%20DOWN.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.XkuOy0BFvKJTewGS\" data-id=\"XkuOy0BFvKJTewGS\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\">Enraged</a>, her <strong>DEF </strong>and <strong>MDEF</strong> is<strong> reduced </strong>by<strong> 2; however,&nbsp;</strong>she also deals <strong>5</strong> extra damage on all attacks.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Grieving Fury"
        }
      },
