          "details": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/magic_hammer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.VCBaZfA3PZzN4sx3\" data-id=\"VCBaZfA3PZzN4sx3\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\">Massive</a></strong></p>\n<p>This attack ignores&nbsp;<strong>Fire Resistance</strong>.</p>",
